<div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
  <div>
    <div class="text-sm text-slate-500">Pengguna → Siswa</div>
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Import Masal Siswa</h1>
    <p class="mt-1 text-slate-600">Upload Excel (.xlsx) / CSV untuk menambah atau memperbarui akun siswa secara cepat.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="flex gap-2">
    <a href="/admin/users" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-100">Kembali</a>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="mt-6 grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
  <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-100 p-5">
    <div class="text-lg font-semibold">Langkah & Format</div>
    <ul class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600 list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
      <li>Download template Excel, isi data siswa, lalu upload.</li>
      <li>Kolom wajib: <span class="font-mono text-slate-900">username</span> (NIS), <span class="font-mono text-slate-900">full_name</span>, <span class="font-mono text-slate-900">class</span>.</li>
      <li>Kolom opsional: <span class="font-mono text-slate-900">password</span>, <span class="font-mono text-slate-900">nomor_peserta</span>, <span class="font-mono text-slate-900">sesi</span>.</li>
      <li>Jika username sudah ada, data akan <b>diperbarui</b>. Jika belum ada, akun baru <b>dibuat</b>.</li>
      <li>File hasil <b>Download Excel</b> di halaman Kelola Pengguna dapat langsung diimport kembali.</li>
    </ul>

    <!-- Kolom yang didukung -->
    <div class="mt-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200 p-4">
      <div class="text-sm font-semibold mb-2">Kolom yang didukung</div>
      <table class="w-full text-xs">
        <thead><tr class="bg-slate-50"><th class="text-left p-1.5 border border-slate-200">Kolom</th><th class="text-left p-1.5 border border-slate-200">Keterangan</th><th class="text-center p-1.5 border border-slate-200">Wajib</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td class="font-mono p-1.5 border border-slate-100">username</td><td class="p-1.5 border border-slate-100">NIS / username login</td><td class="text-center p-1.5 border border-slate-100 text-emerald-600 font-bold">Ya</td></tr>
          <tr class="bg-slate-50"><td class="font-mono p-1.5 border border-slate-100">full_name</td><td class="p-1.5 border border-slate-100">Nama lengkap siswa</td><td class="text-center p-1.5 border border-slate-100 text-emerald-600 font-bold">Ya</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="font-mono p-1.5 border border-slate-100">class</td><td class="p-1.5 border border-slate-100">Nama kelas (sesuai menu Kelas)</td><td class="text-center p-1.5 border border-slate-100 text-emerald-600 font-bold">Ya*</td></tr>
          <tr class="bg-slate-50"><td class="font-mono p-1.5 border border-slate-100">password</td><td class="p-1.5 border border-slate-100">Password login (kosong = tidak berubah)</td><td class="text-center p-1.5 border border-slate-100 text-slate-400">Tidak</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="font-mono p-1.5 border border-slate-100">nomor_peserta</td><td class="p-1.5 border border-slate-100">Nomor peserta ujian (kartu & bangku)</td><td class="text-center p-1.5 border border-slate-100 text-slate-400">Tidak</td></tr>
          <tr class="bg-slate-50"><td class="font-mono p-1.5 border border-slate-100">sesi</td><td class="p-1.5 border border-slate-100">Sesi ujian: 1 / 2 / 3 dst</td><td class="text-center p-1.5 border border-slate-100 text-slate-400">Tidak</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="font-mono p-1.5 border border-slate-100">role</td><td class="p-1.5 border border-slate-100">STUDENT / TEACHER / ADMIN</td><td class="text-center p-1.5 border border-slate-100 text-slate-400">Tidak</td></tr>
          <tr class="bg-slate-50"><td class="font-mono p-1.5 border border-slate-100">status</td><td class="p-1.5 border border-slate-100">Aktif / Nonaktif (diabaikan saat import)</td><td class="text-center p-1.5 border border-slate-100 text-slate-400">Tidak</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
      <a href="/admin/users/import/template"
        class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl border border-indigo-300 bg-indigo-50 hover:bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-700 font-semibold text-sm">
        Download Template XLSX
      </a>
      <a href="/public/templates/student_import_template.csv"
        class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-100 text-sm">
        Download Template CSV
      </a>
      <a href="/admin/classes" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-100 text-sm">Cek Daftar Kelas</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-100 p-5">
    <div class="text-lg font-semibold">Upload Import</div>
    <form action="/admin/users/import/preview" method="POST" enctype="multipart/form-data" class="mt-4 space-y-4">
      <div>
        <label class="text-sm text-slate-600">File Excel/CSV</label>
        <input type="file" name="file" accept=".xlsx,.csv,application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet,text/csv" required class="mt-1 w-full rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200 px-4 py-3" />
        <div class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-500">Disarankan per 200–500 siswa per file agar proses stabil.</div>
      </div>
      <button class="w-full rounded-xl bg-indigo-500 hover:bg-indigo-400 text-white font-semibold py-3">Preview & Validasi</button>
    </form>

    <div class="mt-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200 p-4">
      <div class="text-sm font-semibold">Daftar Kelas (ringkas)</div>
      <div class="mt-2 text-xs text-slate-600">Pastikan kolom <span class="font-mono">class/kelas</span> sesuai persis.</div>
      <div class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        <% (classes || []).slice(0, 18).forEach(c => { %>
          <span class="text-xs px-2 py-1 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50"><span class="font-mono"><%= c.code || '-' %></span> — <%= c.name %></span>
        <% }) %>
        <% if ((classes || []).length > 18) { %>
          <span class="text-xs text-slate-500">+ <%= (classes || []).length - 18 %> kelas lainnya</span>
        <% } %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
